          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi mambo gosi ga Hezekiya chigosala na mahendoge manono, gaandikpwa kpwenye chitabu choandikpwa ruwiya za nabii Isaya, mwana wa Amozi, gaandikpwa kpwenye Chitabu cha mahendo ga afalume a Juda na Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiya wafwa, na achimzika kpwenye vikura vya afalume a chivyazi cha Daudi. Atu osi a Juda na a Jerusalemu amupha ishimu yostahili, naye mwanawe Manase watawala badalaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.33"
            ]
          }
        }
